  "data": {
    "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">各位亲爱的指挥官： </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">司令部将于</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">9</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月4日</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">10:00~15:00</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">对以下港区进行为期5小时的改造建设（如有变动将会另行发布通知）。改建期间将暂时无法进入港区，还请各位指挥官提前做好下线准备，</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">给各位带来的不便敬请谅解。</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">『涉及港区』 </span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">安卓全港区、iOS全港区</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">、HarmonyOS NEXT全港区</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">『改建内容』</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">一、内容新增</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">1.开启限时活动「作战准备：新纪元都市NO.7」，活动时间9月</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">4</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日维护后~10月</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">7</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日23:59，共分为2个阶段</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&lt;第一阶段：紧急作战准备&gt;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">9月</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">4</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日维护后~9月</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">8</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日维护，角色</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">标枪、亚利桑那、暴风雨、妮米、弗蕾娜</strong><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">出击获取的经验提升；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※同时，以上角色可完成第二阶段中的&ldquo;特别任务&rdquo;并获得&ldquo;训练点数&rdquo;；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&lt;第二阶段：特别任务&gt;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">9月</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">8</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日维护后~10月</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">7</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日23:59，使用指定角色完成&ldquo;特别任务&rdquo;获得训练点数，达到指定训练点数可领取</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">特别纪念头像框「萌芽之冠」</strong><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">2.开启限时活动「</strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">闪耀的&ldquo;魔法&rdquo;</strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">」，活动时间</strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">9</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月4日维护后~9月30日</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">23:59</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">活动期间累计签到，完成5日签到，可获得<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">埃米尔&middot;贝尔汀限定换装「闪耀的&ldquo;魔法&rdquo;」</strong>。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">「信标&middot;META」限时开放「萨拉托加&middot;META」挑战，开放时间9月</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日维护后~12月1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">0</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日维护</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">活动期间，可通过挑战「萨拉托加</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&middot;</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">META」累计其同步值获得「萨拉托加&middot;META」及其它丰富奖励。</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※当前正在开放的「</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">布里斯托尔&middot;META</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」挑战将于9月</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">4</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日维护后结束，其同步值也将同时停止累计。9月</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">4</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日维护后，「大型作战」中的每日信标解析次数、信标&middot;META挑战次数将会重置；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">4</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">.「信标档案」新增可解析角色：「大黄蜂&middot;META」</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">加入后，「信标档案」可进行解析的角色为：大黄蜂&middot;META、鹩&middot;META、鲨&middot;META、威奇塔&middot;META、罗德尼&middot;META、基洛夫&middot;META、貎&middot;META、阿尔及利亚&middot;META、伊丽莎白女王&middot;META、亚利桑那&middot;META、声望&middot;META、反击&middot;META、格尔林德&middot;META、奥古斯塔&middot;META、蛟&middot;META、海伦娜&middot;META、皇家方舟&middot;META、龙&middot;META；※「信标档案」将继承原有「信标&middot;META」活动结束时指挥官已经获取的同步值；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">5.开启限时活动「</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Fight！都市求职大作战！</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」，活动时间</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">9</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月4日维护后~9月30日</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">23:59</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">9</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月8日为止，每日00:00解锁2个任务</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">的奖励领取</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">，完成5日任务可获得</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">限定</strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">装备「员工通行卡」</strong><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">。</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※所有任务将于活动首日全部解锁，对应活动奖励将于每日0点陆续解锁，最快可于9</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月8日获得限定</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">装备「员工通行卡」</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">6.「科研」系统开启蓝图补完计划「</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">那不勒斯</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」，活动时间</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">9</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月4日维护后~9月30日</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">23:59</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※活动开启后，指挥官可在每次完成军部科研室的研发项目后额外获得一定数量的</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">「蓝图：那不勒斯」</strong><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">，活动期间总计</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">可额外获取</strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">30张</strong><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※该加速活动不占用【定向追赶】功能可获得的150</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">张蓝图额度；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">7</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">.以下角色新增专属特殊兵装：塔林-「冰结流星锤」、格罗斯特-「女仆的爱之铁拳」、优娜米-「绯红蝶语」、苝-「咕咕~咕咕~」、无畏-「粒子存储器」；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">8.开启限时每日挑战「限时兵装训练」，活动时间9月4日维护后~9月10日23:59</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">活动期间，每日可于「每日挑战」中挑战一次「限时兵装训练」，获取「特殊兵装核心」、「兵装强化石」等挑战奖励；同时，将会开放「限时兵装训练」累计完成任务，可获取「特殊兵装核心」、「兵装强化石」等任务奖励。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※指挥官以S评级通关「每日挑战」后，可使用「快速挑战」功能进行挑战；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nb